; Tobramycin model for patients with and without cystic fibrosis, from Hennig 2013.
; Written by Yann Thoma
; Final version : 26.02.2021

$INCLUDE general.header

$PROBLEM Tobramycin model, from Hennig 2013. A priori percentiles.

$INPUT ID TIME EVID AMT CMT SS II DV age sex scr bodyweight height clcr RATE

$INCLUDE general.dataimport

$INCLUDE ch.tucuxi.tobramycin.hennig2013.pkmodel


$ERROR
Y = F * (1 + ETA(5) * 0.204)
if (Y.LT.0) Y = 0
IPRED=Y

$OMEGA STANDARD CORRELATION BLOCK(3) FIX
0.259 ; CL
0.658 0.152 ; V1
0.711 0.475 0.418 ; Q

$OMEGA 0.585 STANDARD FIX ; V2

$OMEGA 1 FIX; EPS1 ; Replacement of SIGMA

; Sigma is replaced by an additional Omega
$SIGMA 0.0 STANDARD FIX

$INCLUDE general.apriori.perc.footer
